<view class="page sync-page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">从教务系统导入</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">支持新版正方 jwglxt · 登录一次，拉取本学期课表</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!cloudReady}}" class="banner">
    <text>云开发未配置，教务同步暂不可用；本地课表不受影响</text>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-card">
    <view class="notice-title">使用前请确认</view>
    <view class="notice-line">· 仅登录你本人所在学校的教务系统</view>
    <view class="notice-line">· 公钥由云函数在登录会话中取回，密码在手机上加密后发送，云函数只转发密文</view>
    <view class="notice-line">· 本小程序与学校官方无关</view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card">
    <view class="form-row" bindtap="onChooseSchool" hover-class="row-hover">
      <text class="form-label">学校</text>
      <text class="form-value">{{schoolName || '选择学校'}}</text>
      <text class="chevron">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="form-row">
      <text class="form-label">教务地址</text>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        value="{{baseUrl}}"
        placeholder="https://jw.example.edu.cn"
        placeholder-class="placeholder"
        bindinput="onBaseUrlInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="form-row">
      <text class="form-label">学号</text>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        value="{{username}}"
        placeholder="教务系统账号"
        placeholder-class="placeholder"
        bindinput="onUsernameInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="form-row">
      <text class="form-label">密码</text>
      <view class="password-wrap">
        <input
          class="form-input password-input"
          password="{{!showPassword}}"
          value="{{password}}"
          placeholder="教务系统密码"
          placeholder-class="placeholder"
          bindinput="onPasswordInput"
        />
        <text class="eye" bindtap="onTogglePassword">{{showPassword ? '隐藏' : '显示'}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{years}}" range-key="label" value="{{yearIndex}}" bindchange="onYearChange">
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">学年</text>
        <text class="form-value">{{years[yearIndex].label}}</text>
        <text class="chevron">›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{terms}}" range-key="label" value="{{termIndex}}" bindchange="onTermChange">
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">学期</text>
        <text class="form-value">{{terms[termIndex].label}}</text>
        <text class="chevron">›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <view class="form-row switch-row">
      <view>
        <text class="switch-label">记住密码</text>
        <text class="switch-hint">仅保存在本机，不同步到云端</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{remember}}" color="#1f1f1c" bindchange="onRememberChange" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{baseUrl && !secureSupported}}" class="manual-only-card">
    <view class="manual-only-title">该学校暂不支持自动导入</view>
    <view class="manual-only-desc">
      为了保护密码，目前只对部分学校开放手机端加密导入。你可以手动添加课程，课表、今日课程和导入导出功能都可以正常使用。
    </view>
    <view class="primary-btn manual-only-btn" bindtap="onManualAdd">手动添加课程</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="agree-row" bindtap="onToggleAgree">
      <view class="agree-box {{agreed ? 'checked' : ''}}">{{agreed ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <view class="agree-text">我确认使用本人的教务账号，并已阅读<text class="agree-link" catchtap="onPrivacy">《隐私说明》</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="primary-btn {{loading ? 'loading' : ''}}" bindtap="onImport">
      {{loading ? '正在导入…' : '开始导入'}}
    </view>

    <view class="tips">
      <view class="tip">
        <text class="tip-dot"></text>
        <text>导入会替换上次从教务导入的课程，手动课程保留。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="tip">
        <text class="tip-dot"></text>
        <text>密码在手机上加密后发送，云函数只转发密文，不保存密码。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="tip">
        <text class="tip-dot"></text>
        <text>如果学校开启了验证码/滑块，自动导入会失败，需要改为手动添加。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="help-link" bindtap="onHelp">导入遇到问题？查看说明</view>
</view>
